'''Ukyo Kuonji (GR)''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 602
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Ukyo Kuonji (GR)
|name2 = Ukyo Kuonji
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Ukyo Kuonji''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This cat is best used as a crowd controller for groups of metal enemies, as, despite the low attack rate and long cooldown, she can still affect the whole swarm, possibly making the difference between them getting through your defenses or not. See the critical hit chance as nothing more than a small bonus. Her Knockback Immunity is concerning, as it prevents her from repositioning from [[Super Metal Hippoe]]'s knockback effect.

If the threat is a single, powerful metal enemy, however, this unit becomes outclassed by [[Drumcorps Cat (Rare Cat)|Drumcorps Cat]], making the latter the better option, thanks to having the same ability, but better cooldown and attack rate.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Critter}}

